      # @param warning [String] Comma-separated warning risk codes; returns sessions that raised any of them (e.g. `POSSIBLE_FRAUD`). Risk codes are listed per feature in the [warnings documentation](/integration/webhooks). Applies...
      # @param status_initialized_as_in_review [Boolean] When `true`, only sessions whose decision initially landed in `In Review` (useful to audit manual-review volume). KYC rows only.
