      # @param registered_capital_amount [Numeric, nil] Numeric registered-capital amount (up to 20 digits, 2 decimal places). Sets the `registered_capital_amount` column and is mirrored into `registry_data` as a decimal string; the response echoes it as...
      # @param registered_capital_currency [String, nil] ISO 4217 currency code for `registered_capital_amount`. Case-insensitive (`usd` is stored as `USD`); values that are not exactly 3 letters return `400` with the ISO 4217 message. Sets the canonical `...
      # @param website [String] Company website. Bare domains are accepted and normalized with an `https://` prefix (`docsprobe.example.com` is stored as `https://docsprobe.example.com`); values that still fail URL validation retur...
