      # @param poa_address [String, nil] Free-text address as printed on the document. When this value changes (non-sandbox sessions only) and the structured address is still missing or incomplete, the server re-geocodes it in the backgroun...
      # @param name_on_document [String, nil] Recipient name as printed on the document.
      # @param extra_fields [Hash, nil] Document-specific extras, merged key-by-key. Nine keys map to dedicated POA columns: `bank_account_number`, `bank_iban`, `bank_sort_code`, `bank_routing_number`, `bank_swift_bic`, `bank_branch_name`,...
      # @param poa_parsed_address [Hash, nil] Structured address. Only these nested keys are accepted: `address_type`, `city`, `region`, `street_1`, `street_2`, `postal_code`, `country` - any other key returns `400`. Per-key semantics: a value s...
      # @param node_id [String] Workflow graph node whose POA record to patch, for graph workflows with multiple Proof of Address steps (also accepted as a `node_id` body field). When omitted, the most recent POA record on the sess...
      # @param request_options [Hash, nil] :timeout, :max_retries, :extra_headers, :extra_query, :extra_body
      # @return [Didit::Types::SessionsUpdatePoaDataResponse]
      def update_poa_data(session_id, issuing_state: OMIT, document_type: OMIT, document_language: OMIT, issuer: OMIT, issue_date: OMIT, poa_address: OMIT, name_on_document: OMIT, extra_fields: OMIT, poa_parsed_address: OMIT, node_id: OMIT, request_options: nil)
        @client.request(
          :patch,
          "/v3/session/{sessionId}/update-poa-data/",
          path_params: { "sessionId" => session_id },
          query: {
            "node_id" => node_id
          },
